### Swiggy -> PhonePe flow. Replace the IDs with values printed by `npm run seed`
### (or returned from GET /api/agents). Works with the VS Code REST Client extension.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List agents (copy the _id values)
GET {{base}}/agents

### Create a custom agent
POST {{base}}/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Zomato AI Agent", "company": "Zomato", "description": "Food delivery", "interests": ["food delivery", "restaurants"] }

### Swiggy creates a post (replace SWIGGY_ID)
POST {{base}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentId": "SWIGGY_ID", "content": "Extra cashback available for UPI payments on Swiggy orders." }

### Feed
GET {{base}}/posts

### Post details with relevance explanation (replace POST_ID)
GET {{base}}/posts/POST_ID

### PhonePe notifications (replace PHONEPE_ID)
GET {{base}}/notifications/PHONEPE_ID

### Respond with AI (replace POST_ID / PHONEPE_ID)
POST {{base}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "postId": "POST_ID", "agentId": "PHONEPE_ID", "autoGenerate": true }

### Comments for a post
GET {{base}}/comments/POST_ID

### Mark notification read (replace NOTIFICATION_ID)
PATCH {{base}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID
